<rml><head><title>NVMatrixEngine — Fluid Lab</title><link type="text/rcss" href="lab.rcss"/></head><body>
<div id="fps"><span id="render-fps">Render: -- FPS</span><span id="output-fps">DLSS output: -- FPS</span><div id="dlss-status">RR starting</div></div>
<div id="wall-controls"><div class="eyebrow">FLOOD CHAMBER / WALL VALVE</div><button id="wall-water" data-action="wall-water">SPEW WALL WATER [T]</button><div id="water-state"/></div>
<div id="ocean-controls"><div class="eyebrow">OCEAN ISLAND / SKY</div><button id="ocean-time" data-action="environment">SWITCH TO NIGHT [Y]</button></div>
<div id="objective"><div class="eyebrow" id="scene-label">NVMATRIXENGINE / FLUID LAB</div><div class="title" id="objective-title">Water in motion.</div><div class="muted" id="objective-description">Explore simulated water and spectral light transport.</div></div>
<div id="receiver"><div id="charge">RECEIVER / 0%</div><div class="track"><div id="fill"/></div><div id="power"/></div>
<div id="details"><div class="eyebrow" id="details-label">SPECTRAL PLAYGROUND</div><p id="hint"/><p id="laser"/><p id="fluid"/><p id="pt-mode"/><p id="water-description">GPU liquid uses the actual animated surface for refraction and caustics. Secondary whitewater follows the flow; the wall inlet stops safely at capacity.</p><p>Real Bullet bodies · DXR ray generation · spectral photons · DLSS ray reconstruction</p></div>
<div id="tuning"><div class="eyebrow">PRECISION MODE / OPTIC LOCKED</div><div id="pose"/></div>
<div id="context"/>
<div id="shortcuts">L: laser color · U / H: hints &amp; details · Esc: pause · R: reset</div>
<div id="pause"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">NVMATRIXENGINE / SETTINGS</div><h1 id="pause-title">Take a breath</h1>
<button id="resume" data-action="resume">Resume</button>
<div class="section">DLSS &amp; PERFORMANCE</div>
<label>Ray Reconstruction upscaling</label>
<div id="dlss-presets"><button id="dlss-quality" data-action="dlss-quality" data-quality="0">Quality</button><button id="dlss-balanced" data-action="dlss-quality" data-quality="1">Balanced</button><button id="dlss-performance" data-action="dlss-quality" data-quality="2">Performance</button></div>
<p id="dlss-quality-info"/>
<p>Quality renders more detail. Performance renders fewer pixels for higher FPS. Applies immediately.</p>
<button id="frame-gen" data-action="frame-gen">DLSS Frame Generation</button><p id="frame-gen-info"/>
<div class="section">PATH TRACING</div>
<button id="light-sampling" data-action="light-sampling"/>
<button id="russian-roulette" data-action="russian-roulette"/>
<label id="path-samples-value"/><input id="path-samples" type="range" min="1" max="8" step="1" value="1"/>
<label id="light-samples-value"/><input id="light-samples" type="range" min="1" max="8" step="1" value="2"/>
<label id="light-candidates-value"/><input id="light-candidates" type="range" min="1" max="8" step="1" value="4"/>
<label id="path-bounces-value"/><input id="path-bounces" type="range" min="1" max="8" step="1" value="4"/>
<p>Applies immediately in every scene. More samples reduce noise and cost more GPU time. Fast resampling selects light candidates before tracing their shadows. Optical adaptive sampling can add paths above the base count.</p>
<div class="section">CAMERA &amp; LIGHT</div>
<button id="lens" data-action="lens"/><label id="lens-value"/><input id="lens-fov" type="range" min="90" max="160" step="5" value="90"/>
<button id="view" data-action="view"/><p id="camera-help">Right-drag to look. Tab switches views. Hold Space to swim up; Ctrl to dive. Space jumps on land.</p>
<button id="environment" data-action="environment"/><button id="flashlight" data-action="flashlight"/>
<div id="ball-settings"><div class="section">BALL BUOYANCY</div>
<button id="ball-density" data-action="ball-density"/><p id="ball-density-info"/>
<p>Float rises naturally. Sink needs Space held to swim up; release it to sink again. A heavy ball increases the boat's draft.</p></div>
<div id="water-settings"><div class="section">LIQUID QUALITY</div>
<label id="capacity-value"/><input id="particle-limit" type="range" min="100" max="1000" step="50" value="500"/>
<label id="grid-value"/><input id="grid-resolution" type="range" min="10" max="24" step="2" value="16"/>
<label id="rate-value"/><input id="simulation-rate" type="range" min="60" max="180" step="30" value="120"/>
<p id="water-quality-description">Capacity reserves room for the inlet; it does not spawn particles. Finer cells and higher rates cost GPU time. Applying resets the water.</p>
<button id="apply-water" data-action="apply-water">Apply quality &amp; reset water</button></div>
<div class="section">AUDIO</div>
<label>Background music</label><input id="music" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="15" step="1"/>
<button data-action="restart">Restart chamber</button><button data-action="quit">Exit lab</button></div></div>
</body></rml>
